{
  "name": "Demo 1 — Trigger (客人送出訂單)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "ef41afb2-e103-429c-9fde-93d09d355e1c",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [{ "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 30 }]
        }
      },
      "id": "8a6eb022-d89d-40f3-9497-12797eca7e16",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [200, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "food-order",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "id": "bc60cc7c-f5d3-4516-b873-39c43635872c",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [200, 780]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "orderId", "value": "={{ $now.toFormat(\"yyyyMMddHHmmss\") }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "2", "name": "item", "value": "={{ $json.body?.item ?? $json.item ?? \"拿鐵\" }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "3", "name": "qty", "value": "={{ $json.body?.qty ?? $json.qty ?? 1 }}", "type": "number" },
            { "id": "4", "name": "status", "value": "received", "type": "string" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "7b8e30f8-5ea3-4262-b2a6-c84e1fee5d6f",
      "name": "Format Order Receipt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [520, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={ \"success\": true, \"orderId\": \"{{ $json.orderId }}\", \"message\": \"訂單已收到！\" }"
      },
      "id": "6b0da702-a490-4287-8630-e92a9c410b41",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [780, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Demo 1：Trigger 觸發節點\n### 比喻：客人按下「送出訂單」\n\n**核心概念：** 每個 Workflow 至少需要一個 Trigger 來啟動\n\n| 觸發類型 | 用途 | 實際場景 |\n|---------|------|--------|\n| Manual | 手動按鈕測試 | 開發除錯用 |\n| Schedule | 定時自動執行 | 每 30 分鐘巡檢 |\n| Webhook | 外部系統呼叫 | LINE Bot / App |\n\n**教學重點：** 三個 Trigger 都連到同一個節點 (fan-in 模式)",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Manual Trigger\n按一下就跑，開發測試最方便\n\n→ 搭配 pinData 預設資料\n不需要真的發 HTTP",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-manual",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Schedule Trigger\n時間到自動觸發\n\n每 30 分鐘 = 自動重複訂單\n像是定期備份、排程報表",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-schedule",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Webhook Trigger\n外部系統 POST 進來觸發\n\n這是 LINE Bot 實際用的方式\npath: /webhook/food-order",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-webhook",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 780]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 共用處理區\n三種觸發 → 同一個 Format 節點\n\n**Fan-in 模式：**\n多條入口，一個出口\n\n→ Respond to Webhook 只在\nWebhook 觸發時才會執行",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "sticky-process",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 340]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Format Order Receipt", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Schedule Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Format Order Receipt", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Webhook Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Format Order Receipt", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Format Order Receipt": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond to Webhook", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
